{"input":"Executable task contract:\nJSON scalar values in this task are null, boolean, integer (excluding boolean), or string. No floating point or coercion is used. Scalar equality is type-sensitive. Malformed tasks are outside the valid-task domain.\nInput: `states` and `actions` are nonempty lists of distinct strings. `observable` maps every state to one JSON scalar. `transition` maps every state to a total mapping from every action to an existing state. All transitions are deterministic. Begin by grouping states with type-sensitive equal observable values. Canonicalize every partition by sorting names within each group and then sorting the groups lexicographically by their full name sequences. Repeatedly refine: two states remain in the same group exactly when their observable values match and, for every action sorted lexicographically, their successor states belong to the same group in the PREVIOUS partition. Stop when the canonical partition is unchanged. This fixed point is exact equivalence for every finite sequence of actions' future observables. IDs of final classes are zero-based positions in the canonical final partition. Return exactly `{classes:[[state_names]],state_to_class:{state_name:class_id},abstract_transitions:[{class_id,action,next_class}],abstract_observable:[{class_id,value}]}`. Emit abstract_transitions by increasing class_id then lexicographic action. Emit abstract_observable by increasing class_id. Any state in a final class gives the same successor class for each action and the same observable; use its lexicographically first member to compute the output. This is exact finite transition equivalence and does not claim training of a latent model.\nTask JSON:\n{\"kind\":\"predictive_abstraction\",\"states\":[\"x\",\"y\",\"w\",\"u\",\"z\",\"v\"],\"actions\":[\"pulse\",\"turn\",\"rest\"],\"observable\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"w\":0,\"u\":0,\"z\":0,\"v\":1},\"transition\":{\"x\":{\"pulse\":\"y\",\"turn\":\"w\",\"rest\":\"x\"},\"y\":{\"pulse\":\"w\",\"turn\":\"u\",\"rest\":\"y\"},\"w\":{\"pulse\":\"u\",\"turn\":\"z\",\"rest\":\"w\"},\"u\":{\"pulse\":\"z\",\"turn\":\"v\",\"rest\":\"u\"},\"z\":{\"pulse\":\"v\",\"turn\":\"x\",\"rest\":\"z\"},\"v\":{\"pulse\":\"v\",\"turn\":\"y\",\"rest\":\"v\"}}}","target":{"abstract_observable":[{"class_id":0,"value":0},{"class_id":1,"value":1},{"class_id":2,"value":0},{"class_id":3,"value":0},{"class_id":4,"value":0},{"class_id":5,"value":0}],"abstract_transitions":[{"action":"pulse","class_id":0,"next_class":5},{"action":"rest","class_id":0,"next_class":0},{"action":"turn","class_id":0,"next_class":1},{"action":"pulse","class_id":1,"next_class":1},{"action":"rest","class_id":1,"next_class":1},{"action":"turn","class_id":1,"next_class":4},{"action":"pulse","class_id":2,"next_class":0},{"action":"rest","class_id":2,"next_class":2},{"action":"turn","class_id":2,"next_class":5},{"action":"pulse","class_id":3,"next_class":4},{"action":"rest","class_id":3,"next_class":3},{"action":"turn","class_id":3,"next_class":2},{"action":"pulse","class_id":4,"next_class":2},{"action":"rest","class_id":4,"next_class":4},{"action":"turn","class_id":4,"next_class":0},{"action":"pulse","class_id":5,"next_class":1},{"action":"rest","class_id":5,"next_class":5},{"action":"turn","class_id":5,"next_class":3}],"classes":[["u"],["v"],["w"],["x"],["y"],["z"]],"state_to_class":{"u":0,"v":1,"w":2,"x":3,"y":4,"z":5}}}
{"input":"Executable task contract:\nJSON scalar values in this task are null, boolean, integer (excluding boolean), or string. No floating point or coercion is used. Scalar equality is type-sensitive. Malformed tasks are outside the valid-task domain.\nInput: `states` and `actions` are nonempty lists of distinct strings. `observable` maps every state to one JSON scalar. `transition` maps every state to a total mapping from every action to an existing state. All transitions are deterministic. Begin by grouping states with type-sensitive equal observable values. Canonicalize every partition by sorting names within each group and then sorting the groups lexicographically by their full name sequences. Repeatedly refine: two states remain in the same group exactly when their observable values match and, for every action sorted lexicographically, their successor states belong to the same group in the PREVIOUS partition. Stop when the canonical partition is unchanged. This fixed point is exact equivalence for every finite sequence of actions' future observables. IDs of final classes are zero-based positions in the canonical final partition. Return exactly `{classes:[[state_names]],state_to_class:{state_name:class_id},abstract_transitions:[{class_id,action,next_class}],abstract_observable:[{class_id,value}]}`. Emit abstract_transitions by increasing class_id then lexicographic action. Emit abstract_observable by increasing class_id. Any state in a final class gives the same successor class for each action and the same observable; use its lexicographically first member to compute the output. This is exact finite transition equivalence and does not claim training of a latent model.\nTask JSON:\n{\"transition\":{\"v\":{\"rest\":\"v\",\"turn\":\"y\",\"pulse\":\"v\"},\"z\":{\"rest\":\"z\",\"turn\":\"x\",\"pulse\":\"v\"},\"u\":{\"rest\":\"u\",\"turn\":\"v\",\"pulse\":\"z\"},\"w\":{\"rest\":\"w\",\"turn\":\"z\",\"pulse\":\"u\"},\"y\":{\"rest\":\"y\",\"turn\":\"u\",\"pulse\":\"w\"},\"x\":{\"rest\":\"x\",\"turn\":\"w\",\"pulse\":\"y\"}},\"observable\":{\"v\":1,\"z\":0,\"u\":0,\"w\":0,\"y\":0,\"x\":0},\"actions\":[\"pulse\",\"turn\",\"rest\"],\"states\":[\"x\",\"y\",\"w\",\"u\",\"z\",\"v\"],\"kind\":\"predictive_abstraction\"}","target":{"abstract_observable":[{"class_id":0,"value":0},{"class_id":1,"value":1},{"class_id":2,"value":0},{"class_id":3,"value":0},{"class_id":4,"value":0},{"class_id":5,"value":0}],"abstract_transitions":[{"action":"pulse","class_id":0,"next_class":5},{"action":"rest","class_id":0,"next_class":0},{"action":"turn","class_id":0,"next_class":1},{"action":"pulse","class_id":1,"next_class":1},{"action":"rest","class_id":1,"next_class":1},{"action":"turn","class_id":1,"next_class":4},{"action":"pulse","class_id":2,"next_class":0},{"action":"rest","class_id":2,"next_class":2},{"action":"turn","class_id":2,"next_class":5},{"action":"pulse","class_id":3,"next_class":4},{"action":"rest","class_id":3,"next_class":3},{"action":"turn","class_id":3,"next_class":2},{"action":"pulse","class_id":4,"next_class":2},{"action":"rest","class_id":4,"next_class":4},{"action":"turn","class_id":4,"next_class":0},{"action":"pulse","class_id":5,"next_class":1},{"action":"rest","class_id":5,"next_class":5},{"action":"turn","class_id":5,"next_class":3}],"classes":[["u"],["v"],["w"],["x"],["y"],["z"]],"state_to_class":{"u":0,"v":1,"w":2,"x":3,"y":4,"z":5}}}
